226
00:07:09,960 --> 00:07:11,440
I need you to go lie down.

227
00:07:11,440 --> 00:07:13,440
Go upstairs and sleep.

228
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:15,160
Shower if you want.

229
00:07:15,160 --> 00:07:16,760
If not, just lie down for a bit, okay?

230
00:07:22,020 --> 00:07:22,700
