245
00:08:19,440 --> 00:08:20,880
They're so cute.

246
00:08:20,880 --> 00:08:22,760
So sweet. I love it.

247
00:08:23,400 --> 00:08:24,800
I'll squeeze in.

248
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:26,440
Sure. Go squeeze in.

249
00:08:27,900 --> 00:08:30,900
